% GENERATED — Game of Life, the sync shape authored as text.
catalog gol 2.
provenance hand "text recode of the sync compilation" "2026-07-22".
layers (dyn).
stages (mark update sweep).
type cell {x1__y1 x1__y2 x1__y3 x2__y1 x2__y2 x2__y3 x3__y1 x3__y2 x3__y3}.
type idx {i0 .. i9}.
namespace state produce (dyn).
pred a(cell) : state.
pred d(cell) : state.
pred pa(cell) : state.
pred pd(cell) : state.
pred tok(cell) : state.
pred na(cell) : state.
pred nd(cell) : state.
pred force(cell) : state.
pred m(idx) : state.
pred u(idx) : state.
pred s(idx) : state.
bwd cidx(cell,idx).
bwd succ(idx,idx).
bwd adj(cell,cell).
cidx(x1__y1,i0).
